{"version":1,"content":"<p>一種經過基因改造的病毒在美國一項早期臨牀試驗中，使三名胰腺癌患者的腫瘤停止生長和擴散，為這種致死率極高的癌症治療帶來了新的希望。不過，研究人員強調，目前仍需要更大規模的試驗來驗證其療效和安全性。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1587292.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T11:43:57.624341+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":102,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T11:29:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T11:37:16.097146+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T11:37:16.097146+00:00","content_hash":"65ac50ff2d37fe9738d04cdfd506f2632a69ff0d6148339cefa1f7c64e1fe32c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}